1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
My dad asked if this was complicated.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Here's the whole thing in thirty seconds.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,800
You get in with a code from your parish.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,800
Asking takes about a minute, a line or two.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:19,800
Nothing about you is shared
until you accept a match.

6
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,000
And when both say yes, there it is.

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,800
Contact, shared between you two and your coordinator.

8
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,400
Reciprocal aid dot network.
Ask your coordinator for a code.
